From 819e4f36b1458a27a8523530b499d2da47bf3fad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antoine Bartuccio <antoine.bartuccio@vates.tech>
Date: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 14:04:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(linstor): implement vdi_revert

* Allow re-running the rollback journal even if it crashed
* Support `vdi_revert`
* Add journals for rollback in case of failure
* Add critical journal support

Signed-off-by: Antoine Bartuccio <antoine.bartuccio@vates.tech>
